# REST API

## Interactive reference

The iframe below renders the OpenAPI specification (`openapi.json` in the
repository root, copied to `docs/reference/openapi.json` by
`mise run docs:refresh`) in a standalone Swagger UI page. The Swagger UI
bundle is loaded from the jsDelivr CDN at runtime, so **this page needs
network access**.

See the generated [endpoint tables](endpoints.md) for the austere, offline
version of the same contract.

